---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Advertise on AI Tools HQ — Get Your Tool in Front of 20K+ Buyers"
  description="Claim or upgrade your listing on AI Tools HQ. Featured badges, verified status, and newsletter placement. Starting at $49/mo. No setup fees."
>
  <main class="advertise-page">
    <header class="page-header">
      <div class="badge">For Tool Makers</div>
      <h1>Claim Your Listing</h1>
      <p>AI Tools HQ reviews 139+ tools and gets 20K+ monthly visitors actively evaluating AI tools. If your tool is listed — or should be — here's how to get maximum visibility.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="stats-row">
      <div class="stat">
        <span class="stat-number">20K+</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Monthly Visitors</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <span class="stat-number">139</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Tools Reviewed</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <span class="stat-number">High Intent</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Buyer Audience</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <span class="stat-number">$0</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Setup Fee</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="tiers">
      <h2>Listing Tiers</h2>
      <p class="tiers-sub">Month-to-month. Cancel anytime. One sponsor per slot.</p>

      <div class="tier-grid">

        <div class="tier-card">
          <div class="tier-header">
            <div>
              <span class="tier-badge free">Free</span>
              <span class="tier-name">Standard Listing</span>
            </div>
            <div class="tier-price">
              <span class="price">$0</span>
              <span class="per">/mo</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <ul class="tier-features">
            <li>Tool page with full review</li>
            <li>Listed in category directory</li>
            <li>Indexed by Google</li>
            <li>Alternatives page inclusion</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="tier-note">Already listed? You're on this tier.</div>
          <a href="mailto:hello@ai-tools-hq.com?subject=Add My Tool&body=Hi, I'd like to get my tool listed. Tool name:" class="tier-cta">Request a Listing</a>
        </div>

        <div class="tier-card tier-popular">
          <div class="popular-badge">Most Popular</div>
          <div class="tier-header">
            <div>
              <span class="tier-badge featured">Featured</span>
              <span class="tier-name">Featured Tool</span>
            </div>
            <div class="tier-price">
              <span class="price">$49</span>
              <span class="per">/mo</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <ul class="tier-features">
            <li>Everything in Standard</li>
            <li>"Featured" badge on your tool card</li>
            <li>Priority position in category listings</li>
            <li>Gold border highlight on tool card</li>
            <li>Featured on homepage "Handpicked" section</li>
            <li>Affiliate/referral link on your page</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="tier-note">Best for: Tools already listed wanting more traffic.</div>
          <a href="mailto:hello@ai-tools-hq.com?subject=Featured Listing - $49/mo&body=Hi, I'd like the $49/mo Featured listing. My tool is:" class="tier-cta tier-cta-primary">Get Featured →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="tier-card tier-premium">
          <div class="tier-header">
            <div>
              <span class="tier-badge verified">Verified</span>
              <span class="tier-name">Verified Sponsor</span>
            </div>
            <div class="tier-price">
              <span class="price">$199</span>
              <span class="per">/mo</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <ul class="tier-features">
            <li>Everything in Featured</li>
            <li>"Verified Sponsor" badge on tool page</li>
            <li>Category page header placement</li>
            <li>Homepage above-fold feature slot</li>
            <li>Weekly newsletter mention</li>
            <li>Monthly performance report</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="tier-note">Best for: Tools competing for category authority.</div>
          <a href="mailto:hello@ai-tools-hq.com?subject=Verified Sponsor - $199/mo&body=Hi, I'm interested in the $199/mo Verified Sponsor tier. My tool is:" class="tier-cta">Become a Sponsor →</a>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="top-alt-card">
        <div class="top-alt-header">
          <div>
            <span class="tier-badge alt">Top Alternative</span>
            <h3>Own a Competitor's Alternatives Page</h3>
            <p>Be the #1 recommendation when someone searches for "[Competitor] alternatives." We'll build a dedicated page targeting your competitor's exact keywords.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="top-alt-price">
            <span class="price">$349</span>
            <span class="per">/mo</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <ul class="top-alt-features">
          <li>Everything in Verified Sponsor</li>
          <li>Exclusive #1 slot on a targeted "[Competitor] alternatives" page</li>
          <li>Sponsored case study writeup (500 words)</li>
          <li>Dedicated page indexed for competitor keywords</li>
          <li>Monthly performance report with rankings data</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="mailto:hello@ai-tools-hq.com?subject=Top Alternative Sponsorship - $349/mo&body=Hi, I'm interested in the $349/mo Top Alternative slot. My tool competes with:" class="tier-cta tier-cta-primary">Claim Your Slot →</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="why-section">
      <h2>Why Tool Makers Choose Us</h2>
      <div class="why-grid">
        <div class="why-card">
          <span class="why-icon">🎯</span>
          <h3>Buyer Intent Traffic</h3>
          <p>Our visitors are actively researching tools to purchase — not casual browsers. Average session: 4+ pages, high click-through on affiliate links.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-card">
          <span class="why-icon">🔍</span>
          <h3>SEO Value</h3>
          <p>Tool pages rank for "[Tool name] review", "[Tool] pricing", and "[Tool] alternatives" — queries with purchase intent. We capture the bottom of the funnel.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-card">
          <span class="why-icon">📊</span>
          <h3>Transparent Reporting</h3>
          <p>Verified Sponsor and Top Alternative tiers include monthly reports: page views, click-through rate, referral traffic to your site.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="faq-section">
      <h2>Common Questions</h2>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>My tool isn't listed yet — can I still advertise?</h3>
          <p>Yes. We'll add and review your tool as part of onboarding. Just email us and we'll have it live within 48 hours.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Is there a minimum commitment?</h3>
          <p>No. All tiers are month-to-month. Cancel with 7 days notice before your next billing cycle.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Are sponsored placements disclosed?</h3>
          <p>Yes — always. Sponsored and Featured listings are clearly labeled per FTC guidelines. Our editorial reviews remain independent.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Can I get a specific category page placement?</h3>
          <p>Yes — the Verified Sponsor tier includes category-level placement. Popular categories (Coding, Writing, Video) fill up fast.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Do you offer affiliate partnerships instead?</h3>
          <p>Yes — if your tool has an affiliate program, email us. We'll review it and may add an affiliate link to your listing at no charge (performance-based).</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-box">
      <h2>Ready to get in front of buyers?</h2>
      <p>Email us and we'll confirm your slot within 24 hours. No sales calls. No setup fees.</p>
      <a href="mailto:hello@ai-tools-hq.com?subject=Advertise on AI Tools HQ" class="btn-primary">Email Us Now →</a>
      <p class="cta-sub">Or reach out on X: <a href="https://x.com/AIToolsHQ" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@AIToolsHQ</a></p>
      <p class="cta-sub">See also: <a href="/sponsors">Full sponsorship details →</a></p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .advertise-page {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 8rem 2rem 4rem;
  }

  .page-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.3rem 1rem;
    background: var(--success-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--success-border-strong);
    border-radius: 50px;
    color: var(--accent-primary);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .page-header h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .page-header p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .stats-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--border-subtle);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .stat {
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .stat-number {
    display: block;
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .stat-label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .tiers h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .tiers-sub {
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .tier-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .tier-card {
    position: relative;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }

  .tier-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--white-20);
  }

  .tier-popular {
    border-color: var(--accent-primary);
    background: var(--white-02);
  }

  .tier-premium {
    border-color: var(--accent-glow-strong);
  }

  .popular-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: -12px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: var(--accent-primary);
    color: var(--bg-primary);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.25rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 50px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .tier-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .tier-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .tier-badge.free { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); color: var(--text-muted); }
  .tier-badge.featured { background: rgba(255, 180, 0, 0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 180, 0, 0.3); color: #ffb400; }
  .tier-badge.verified { background: var(--success-bg); border: 1px solid var(--success-border-strong); color: var(--accent-primary); }
  .tier-badge.alt { background: rgba(160, 80, 255, 0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(160, 80, 255, 0.3); color: #a050ff; }

  .tier-name {
    display: block;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .tier-price {
    text-align: right;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .price {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent-primary);
  }

  .per {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .tier-features {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .tier-features li {
    padding: 0.4rem 0;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .tier-features li::before {
    content: "✓";
    color: var(--accent-primary);
    font-weight: 700;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .tier-note {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--white-50);
    font-style: italic;
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .tier-cta {
    display: block;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 50px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .tier-cta:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent-primary);
    color: var(--accent-primary);
  }

  .tier-cta-primary {
    background: var(--accent-primary);
    color: var(--bg-primary);
    border-color: var(--accent-primary);
  }

  .tier-cta-primary:hover {
    background: var(--accent-secondary);
    color: var(--bg-primary);
  }

  /* Top Alternative full-width card */
  .top-alt-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid rgba(160, 80, 255, 0.3);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .top-alt-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
  }

  .top-alt-header h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: 0.35rem 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .top-alt-header p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 520px;
  }

  .top-alt-price {
    text-align: right;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .top-alt-features {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 0.4rem 2rem;
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
  }

  .top-alt-features li {
    padding: 0.3rem 0;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .top-alt-features li::before {
    content: "✓";
    color: #a050ff;
    font-weight: 700;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .top-alt-card .tier-cta {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    max-width: 240px;
  }

  /* Why section */
  .why-section {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .why-section h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .why-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .why-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }

  .why-icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .why-card h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .why-card p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* FAQ */
  .faq-section {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .faq-section h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .faq-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .faq-item {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .faq-item h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .faq-item p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* CTA */
  .cta-box {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding: 3rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 20px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cta-box h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .cta-box > p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.875rem 2.5rem;
    background: var(--accent-primary);
    color: var(--bg-primary);
    border-radius: 50px;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: all 0.3s;
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--accent-secondary);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .cta-sub {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .cta-sub a {
    color: var(--accent-primary);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .advertise-page {
      padding: 7rem 1.5rem 3rem;
    }

    .stats-row {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .tier-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .why-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .top-alt-card {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .top-alt-features {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
